OL,3,GNEWSABaby death FAI told doctor did not
OL,4,Aknow of inherited condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor has told a fatal accident
OL,7,Finquiry (FAI) he would have advised a
OL,8,Fbaby was not operated on had he known
OL,9,Fabout an inherited heart condition
OL,10,Fwhich was the suspected cause of death
OL,11,Fof the child's older brother.
OL,13,FMichael Wilson was born on 11 August
OL,14,F2021 at Aberdeen Maternity Hospital and
OL,15,Fdied aged two months at the Royal
OL,16,FAberdeen Children's Hospital on 15
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,19,FMichael's brother had an inherited
OL,20,Fheart condition and had died from
OL,21,Fcomplications after cardiac surgery.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
